    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11681" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεθίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>disaccustom,</i>
			
